<title>UK: BNG sets 1.5 billion guilder 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>BNG sets 1.5 billion guilder 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK NEDERLANDSE GEMEENTEN</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN DFL   COUPON     6.125     MATURITY    30.OCT.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.575   PAY DATE    30.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.90     SPREAD	+16.5 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  NETHER    TAX PROVS   DOMESTIC</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  1.675     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND OVER THE CURVE -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
